Description: Provides a reproducible framework for publication-quality
    single-cell RNA sequencing analysis using Seurat. The package standardizes
    visualization, input validation, file output, module score analysis,
    differential expression analysis, pseudobulk analysis, and related
    utilities for biomedical research.
